---@class azure.cosmos_db.ComponentsM9L909SchemasCassandraclusterpublicstatusPropertiesDatacentersItemsPropertiesNodesItems
---@field address? string The node's IP address.
---@field state? azure.cosmos_db.NodeState The state of the node in Cassandra ring.
---@field status? string
---@field cassandraProcessStatus? string Cassandra service status on this node
---@field load? string The amount of file system data in the data directory (e.g., 47.66 kB), excluding all content in the snapshots subdirectories. Because all SSTable data files are included, any data that is not cleaned up (such as TTL-expired cells or tombstones) is counted.
---@field tokens? azure.cosmos_db.ComponentsM9L909SchemasCassandraclusterpublicstatusPropertiesDatacentersItemsPropertiesNodesItemsTokensList List of tokens this node covers.
---@field size? number
---@field hostID? string The network ID of the node.
---@field rack? string The rack this node is part of.
---@field timestamp? string The timestamp when these statistics were captured.
---@field diskUsedKB? number The amount of disk used, in kB, of the directory /var/lib/cassandra.
---@field diskFreeKB? number The amount of disk free, in kB, of the directory /var/lib/cassandra.
---@field memoryUsedKB? number Used memory (calculated as total - free - buffers - cache), in kB.
---@field memoryBuffersAndCachedKB? number Memory used by kernel buffers (Buffers in /proc/meminfo) and page cache and slabs (Cached and SReclaimable in /proc/meminfo), in kB.
---@field memoryFreeKB? number Unused memory (MemFree and SwapFree in /proc/meminfo), in kB.
